# Remote Turn Gate 3 — yh layer secret names (never values)

Core:
- REMOTE_TURN_SIGNING_KEY=<ed25519 private key pem>   # 08 §5.2
- REMOTE_TURN_TRANSPORTS={"<service-id>":"<base-url>"} # 08 §5.4

Attestor:
- ATTESTOR_KEY=<ed25519 private key pem>              # 08 §3.2
- ATTESTOR_PG_URL=<attestor database url>             # 08 §3.2 durability
- ATTESTOR_MAX_PRECLAIM_SANDBOXES=8                   # 08 §3.2 N7

Runtime:
- RUNTIME_RECEIPT_KEY=<ed25519 private key pem>       # 08 §3.1

Egress-gw:
- METERING_KEY=<ed25519 private key pem>              # 08 §3.3
- EGRESS_TOKEN_SIGNING_KEY=<hmac or signing key>      # 08 §3.3 token mint

Transport / identity (mTLS):
- CORE_MTLS_CERT, CORE_MTLS_KEY, CORE_MTLS_CA
- RUNTIME_MTLS_CERT, RUNTIME_MTLS_KEY
- ATTESTOR_MTLS_CERT, ATTESTOR_MTLS_KEY
- EGRESS_MTLS_CERT, EGRESS_MTLS_KEY

G0 verifier (08 §5.1 static-keys mode):
- G0_CONTEXT_VERIFIER=static-keys
- G0_CONTEXT_VERIFIER_KEYS=<public key json>

Teardown / lease-push tuning:
- REMOTE_TURN_USAGE_GRACE_MS=15000                   # 08 §5.4a N3
- REMOTE_TURN_LEASE_PUSH_DEADLINE_MS=60000           # 08 §5.4a N5
